==English==
===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[perfect]] [[pitch]]'''

#{{music}} The [[ability]] to identify a [[note]] by name without the benefit of a [[reference]] note. 
#(less common) The exact pitch of a note described by its [[frequency]] in [[vibrations]] per [[second]].

